{"reviewId": "230585179_868Y5gnjT", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "M顶，第一次见顶，资本会把这个游戏带到新兴经济体，等到第二次见顶，才开始进入到萧条阶段。比如08年之前，因为美国的次贷危机而造成全世界的金融危机，这时候我们推出了4万亿刺激计划，将吹泡泡的游戏接力过来。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "5324-5392", "abstract": "间歇期的结束一般以发生新的冲击为标志。我们看到，第二次冲击往往更多发生在新兴经济体或资源国中，比如在第四次康波萧条中陷入悲惨增长的拉美。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 6, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "230585179_868Y5gnjT", "userVid": 230585179, "topics": [], "createTime": 1768359981, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 230585179, "name": "Jerry", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0009-5r0e36ypfsBhd3oQaqsMm10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "山止川行", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-3000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 3000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 29, "likes": [{"userVid": 49084488, "name": "Wait ", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0016-5KxOwDgbCOS0nZ_3c41Izf6/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M15-2-0", "desc": "21天阅读挑战", "title": "21天阅读挑战", "levelIndex": 0}}], "commentsCount": 2, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "现在是第二次见顶后的下降期吗？衰退期结束了吗？萧条期到来了吗？为什么石油上涨了，黄金价格变贵了", "reviewId": "230585179_868Y5gnjT", "commentId": "230585179_868Y5gnjT_c228106097_87TogkcZA", "userVid": 228106097, "createTime": 177451